<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Final Prague bourse trading figures for Thursday.</title>
<headline>Final Prague bourse trading figures for Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Prague Stock Exchange released the following delayed trading figures for Thursday's session.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 932 million crowns</p>
<p>* Volume 899,294 shares</p>
<p>* 214 shares rose, 180 fell with 73 staying unchanged</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
